# Build output. Not vendored — `test:dashboard` (GitLab CI) builds
# dist/ on every push and exposes it as a pipeline artifact; the
# deploy stage's `needs:` declaration consumes that artifact, so
# the bundle reaches production without the diff churn of a
# committed build. Run `npm run build` locally for dev parity.
